--   **The Kronecker stage.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KFV59CostK`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem NLogN.KFV.cKronS_le (p ℓ n BK φ : ℕ) :
--       cKronS p ℓ n BK φ ≤ 10 ^ 14 * (p + ℓ + 3) * (2 ^ n * 2 ^ ℓ) + 8000 * 2 ^ n * φ +
